GGML Qwen GGUF kernels
-----------------------
Packed projections and the F32 gated-delta recurrence under
crates/lisa-metal/src/shaders/gguf/ originate in llama.cpp/GGML:
https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp
License: MIT; the upstream LICENSE and source revision/hashes are retained
