crates/lisa-metal/src/shaders/common/matmul/dspine_wide.metal and
crates/lisa-metal/src/shaders/nax/dspine_thin.metal retain the arithmetic and
reduction order of MLX v0.32.4's gemv.h and steel_gemm_thin_nax.h.
Copyright © 2023-2024, 2026 Apple Inc. License: MIT (full text above).
The Rust dispatch mirrors that release's matmul.cpp for the qualified
DSpine shapes; the target model's projection dispatch is unchanged.

DSpine affine 4-bit Metal projections
------------------------------------
crates/lisa-metal/src/shaders/common/matmul/dspine_quantized.metal contains
MLX v0.32.4 quantized.h and its gemm_splitk_accum template from
steel/gemm/kernels/steel_gemm_splitk.h. Copyright © 2023-2024 Apple Inc.
License: MIT (full text above). The DSpine-only wrapper retains that
release's promoted input sums and F32 split-K partials. Target kernels
retain their existing arithmetic. Source hashes are recorded in the
DSpine fixture provenance.

The explicit DS4 MXFP8 row decoder in crates/lisa-gguf/src/quant/ds4.rs
is ported from ds4_engram.c at b3f50180ec2c7324892be1f50bc83555ccb8d5e7.
Its MIT license is preserved at crates/lisa-gguf/src/LICENSE-DS4.
